Waste hourly supply[M11,Hour]=
	Waste annual production / 10.6 / 24 / ( 365 / 12 ) ~~|
Waste hourly supply[M12,Hour]=
	Waste annual production / 10.6 / 24 / ( 365 / 12 )
	~	
	~		|

Waste marginal cost=
	12
